    "description": "The Real Estate Listings Price History API provides detailed insights into the price history of various real estate listings. This API allows users to retrieve historical pricing data for specific properties, enabling them to make informed decisions regarding buying, selling, or investing in real estate. Real estate agents, investors, and market analysts typically utilize this data to analyze trends and understand market dynamics. By accessing this endpoint, consumers can gain visibility into pricing fluctuations over time for any given listing.",
